'''Future''' is an [[uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that is obtainable by [[crafting]] it or through trading.

==Appearance==
Its blade has a bright blue futuristic streak imprinted on it, encased in a grayish-blue tube, hence the name. The guard is silver, and the handle is solid black.

==Trivia==
*Players can exchange 12 common [[shards]] through [[crafting]] to obtain it by chance.
*When salvaged, it provides 2 uncommon [[shards]].
*Future's unreleased version was published to the Roblox Library by [[Nikilis]] on February 6, 2020.<ref>[https://www.roblox.com/library/4659639694/FutureKnife The model of the unreleased version] (You can no longer see it now)</ref>

